{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20959","headline":"奉和二兄罢使遣马归延州 · 李贺","name":"奉和二兄罢使遣马归延州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空留三尺劒，不用一丸泥。\n马向沙场去，人归故国来。\n笛愁翻陇水，酒喜沥春灰。\n锦带休惊雁，罗衣尚鬬鸡。\n还吴已渺渺，入郢莫凄凄。\n自是桃李树，何畏不成蹊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}